                "username": "MeghanaVangapandu0"
            },
            "message": "Abandoned\n\nThanks for the review. I've confirmed this scenario doesn't naturally occur in the codebase. The configuration file is always rewritten to canonical form by writeConfig(), so leading comments or blank lines never persist. I will keep this improvement in our internal variant and close this change."
